('feecab88-08bf-413d-acc5-e50ed0368957', '2f33d874-82cf-4d13-870c-f82f7bbd1e38', 'assistant', '{\"action\":\"create_motion\",\"project_name\":\"project-1781463380546\",\"title\":\"Hello World Text Animation\",\"description\":\"Simple fade-in text animation with Hello World message\",\"visual_identity\":{\"primary\":\"#ffffff\",\"background\":\"#111111\",\"text\":\"#ffffff\"},\"tasks\":[{\"action\":\"create_project\",\"label\":\"Initialize project\",\"params\":{\"name\":\"project-1781463380546\"}},{\"action\":\"write_file\",\"label\":\"Write index.html\",\"params\":{\"path\":\"index.html\",\"content\":\"<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\"><style>*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box} body{width:1920px;height:1080px;overflow:hidden;background:#111} .clip{position:absolute;opacity:0} @keyframes fadeInUp{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)}to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0)}} @keyframes moveUp{from{transform:translateY(0)}to{transform:translateY(-20px)}}</style></head><body><div data-composition-id=\\\"main\\\" data-width=\\\"1920\\\" data-height=\\\"1080\\\" data-duration=\\\"5\\\" style=\\\"position:relative;width:1920px;height:1080px\\\"><div class=\\\"clip\\\" data-start=\\\"0\\\" data-duration=\\\"4\\\" data-track-index=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"width:100%;height:100%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;animation:fadeInUp 1s ease forwards; animation-delay:1s\\\"><h1 style=\\\"color:#fff;font-size:80px;font-family:sans-serif\\\">Hello World</h1></div><div class=\\\"clip\\\" data-start=\\\"2\\\" data-duration=\\\"3\\\" data-track-index=\\\"1\\\" style=\\\"width:100%;height:100%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;animation:moveUp 2s ease forwards; animation-delay:2s\\\"><h1 style=\\\"color:#fff;font-size:80px;font-family:sans-serif\\\">Hello World</h1></div></div></body></html>\"},{\"action\":\"render\",\"label\":\"Render video\",\"params\":{\"output\":\"output.mp4\"}}]}}', 'Okay, I need to help the user create a simple motion design with \"Hello World\" text. They mentioned using the HyperFrames HTML template, so I\'ll start by understanding the structure.\n\nFirst, the project name should be a kebab slug. Since their current project is \"project-1781463380546\", I\'ll use that. The title and description should be clear but concise.\n\nLooking at the template, the root div has specific data attributes. I\'ll set data-duration to 5 seconds as per the example. The clip div needs start and duration times. I\'ll have the text fade in at the beginning and then move up slightly for a subtle effect.\n\nFor colors, I\'ll choose a primary white text on a dark background for contrast. The text should be large and centered. I\'ll use sans-serif font for simplicity.\n\nI\'ll structure the JSON with the create_motion action, including the project details and tasks. The main task is writing the index.html file with the updated content. I\'ll ensure the HTML is self-contained and follows all the rules, like using @keyframes and forwards fill-mode.\n\nFinally, I\'ll test the structure in my mind to make sure all elements are correctly placed and animations work as intended. The result should be a clean, minimal hello world animation.', NULL, '2026-06-14 18:56:43'),
